# Deployment Snapshots

This directory contains historical snapshots of deployments.

Each snapshot is automatically created when a deployment or upgrade is performed and includes:

- All configuration parameters used
- Timestamp of deployment
- ARC controller version used
- Operation performed (deploy/upgrade)

Snapshots are named: `YYYY-MM-DD-HHMMSS-snapshot-{scaleset-name}.json`

You can redeploy from a snapshot by copying it to the `deployments/` folder or referencing it directly in the workflow.
